  "label": "Historical Stereotype",
  "description": "A stereotype based on historical events or figures that is used to make a contemporary point. The 'Soviet Amerika' meme relies on the historical stereotype that the Soviet Union was oppressive and authoritarian, which is used to imply that the U.S. government is similarly oppressive. This stereotype is inherently loaded and can be harmful as it oversimplifies complex political systems.",
